Z||000008||voyagerspe||03-07-2001||10:49 PM||||I got the pic thing figured out it was almost as hard as droping the cradel.<P>ARI sells stroker kits for 2.8 to 3.1 and 3.4 <BR>short blocks. No you dont have to relocate the starter (its a 2.8 block thats been "worked") there web site is <A HREF="http://www.engine-parts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.engine-parts.com</A>  I found them when I looked up "fiero" on the yahoo auction page.<P>The engine runs very strong however i havent driven the car yet (except up and down my driveway(1500 ft)) due to all the snow.  ||||reg||10
